  {
    "id": "3443038732",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "The Ultimate Steven Universe Barn Wallpaper",
    "description": "A customizable 4K wallpaper based on the barn title cards of Steven Universe.\nEverything is rendered on engine, from the blinking stars to the flying clouds to even every single swaying leave.\nThe wallpaper can be set between all the versions shown on the show (Night, Dawn, Day or Sunset) or it can be set to smoothly transition between them through the day, with adjustable time of transition and blend duration.\nThere are also two new original versions (Raining and Snowing) to match the temple title cards. When switching the weather, there will be a smooth transition, although it will override the time-of-day transitions.\nThe hanged clothes, including the rope and pole, can be toggled off if you want just a view of the empty field. You can also disable the snow/rain particles.\nThere is also a toggleable Clock and Date made to look like the title cards on the show. The colors in them change with the rest of the wallpaper. The clock can be set to 24H or 12H and the date can be displayed on English or Spanish.\n\n\nI consider this version 2.9.1, aka the last version (excluding hypothetical hotfixes). I literally can’t come up with any feature worth adding, so I’m renaming it to “The Ultimate Steven Universe Barn Wallpaper” and calling it finished. Although I am open to suggestions.\nThis is the first entry of the “The Ultimate Steven Universe Wallpapers” collection. Here is a link to the collection:\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3500057300\n\n\n\nCredits:\nTons of thanks to Phizzy who not only inspired me to do this wallpaper but also provided the original assets for 1.0 which later I heavily modified or even recreated for this 2.0 (now 2.9.1). Here are links to their YouTube channel, and the tutorial that inspired me:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Phizzy\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zHMpFomcyv8\n\nThe Clock uses several modified versions of the Crewniverse Font, recreated by MaxiGamer:\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/maxigamer/art/Crewniverse-Font-V-5-MORE-ACCENTS-AND-SYMBOLS-540122768\n\nThe Date uses the Impallari Dosis (Extra Bold) font:\nhttps://www.fontsquirrel.com/fonts/dosis\n\nThe clouded sky of the raining and snowing version was constructed from a background of the episode “Lars and the Cool Kids” by the Crewniverse and shared on Tumblr:\nhttps://www.tumblr.com/stevencrewniverse/79768471684/a-selection-of-backgrounds-from-the-steven?source=share",
    "author": {
      "name": "",
      "steamId": "76561199033238577"
    },
